	file.0000000000000001.title: "&a&lRizmotopia &b&lv2.0.6"
	quest.007FF6F71BEF7E3C.quest_subtitle: "Before you head out to find your first Meteorite make sure to have an Iron Pickaxe or better. Meteorites are made out of a very hard material called Sky Stone which requires it. Make sure you mine to the center of the meteorite to collect the Certus Quartz Crystals, Certus Quartz Blocks and your Inscriber Presses!"
	quest.007FF6F71BEF7E3C.title: "Your First Meteorite"
	quest.00B093F4B096E8AD.quest_subtitle: "By combining a treetrap with a drain you allow yourself to fully automate the collection of sap by simply placing it next to a rubber tree, letting it collect the sap as it appears. It will even deposit its items into an inventory below it."
	quest.00B67CACCECF1701.quest_subtitle: "An upgrade to the Advanced Jackhammer, allowing for an even bigger mining area."
	quest.00DFC7824C3750FB.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to haunt items.\\n\\nNotably sand into soul sand."
	quest.012565300A42D6AF.quest_subtitle: "This little thing can chare all the items in your inventory "
	quest.0138F3EB263D1721.quest_subtitle: "The block that deals with train assembly and dissasembly."
	quest.018B36596F821C17.quest_subtitle: "Provides seeing in the dark! Batman! Batman! Batman!"
	quest.021AE38A81AD9FAC.quest_subtitle: "Due to the sturdiness of iridium alloy your compressor wont be enough to make plates out of it. Maybe explosions are a must? Controlled ones of course."
	quest.021E30871E97C634.quest_subtitle: "An advanced item distribution machine."
	quest.02382BFB96614F9C.quest_subtitle: "Generates 2 E/t (2.5 E/t during thunderstorms), needs to be placed above y: 64."
	quest.027AD844F4FB9141.quest_subtitle: "Obtained by centrifuging \\n&dGlowstone dust&r or &dEndstone dust&r "
	quest.0306E0A1DA82A811.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that outputs a signal when in contact with another redstone contact. Perticularly useful for building contraptions."
	quest.0336B7089BF62B8C.quest_subtitle: "Staring at enderman no longer makes him angry."
	quest.035929E3D976F3CE.title: "C418 - Ward"
	quest.03B264DBCCC1867C.title: "C418 - 11"
	quest.03FAA1891E7D56FD.quest_subtitle: "A more configurable chute."
	quest.04B3A406760469E3.quest_subtitle: "Provides energy from the sun, generates between 0 e/t and 3 e/t depending on the time of day."
	quest.04F3AC097C350502.quest_subtitle: "Iron reinforced with nickel, creating an alloy stronger than the sum of its parts. \\n\\nCan be used for higher yield crafts of mixed metal ingots or as plates to make some medium tier generators."
	quest.0509A7DCBF619ADD.quest_subtitle: "Immunity to fall damage and small fireballs sent by blaze"
	quest.0530526EE1A4901E.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Iron Alloy Smelter that allows it to run off of energy instead of coal."
	quest.05EB3B0451D44CFF.quest_subtitle: "Attacking creatures stings them, causing posioning, which lasts 4 seconds."
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you schedule trains so that mobs or blaze burnders can drive them."
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles on when recieving a redstone signal on one side and off when recieviing a signal on anoter side."
	quest.0695C594EE70BA1B.quest_subtitle: "Sleeping bag is an item used to craft a Traveler's Backpack. There is a sleeping bag rolled up inside the travelers backpack, allowing you to sleep anywhere."
	quest.0755F9408C40BEAF.quest_subtitle: "\"An enderchest for energy\" - All Interdimensional SUs you place down share the same energy storage. \\n\\nMeaning you can now transport your power anywhere without those pesky wires."
	quest.07680D1563629D55.quest_subtitle: "It's really just a belt that doesn't move."
	quest.07E305E95A000FAF.quest_subtitle: "To open and Entere the &5End portal&r, you will need to use the eyes from the End Remastered. You will need to &2Explore Structures &rto find them, but some of them can be &6Crafted"
	quest.07E305E95A000FAF.title: "Enter &5The End"
	quest.08539D3A6DD8CCC4.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Basic Drill."
	quest.08644942036C18A4.quest_subtitle: "Find your first set of diamonds!"
	quest.08644942036C18A4.title: "Find Diamonds!"
	quest.08C3DCCCD8501DC9.quest_subtitle: "Kill 1 Ghast to complete this quest!"
	quest.0906EC11E1795CC1.quest_subtitle: "A part designed to share energy between two ME Networks without sharing anything else, also used to craft Fluix ME Glass Cable."
	quest.0906EC11E1795CC1.title: "Sharing Power Between Networks"
	quest.092DCB6155BE06E0.quest_subtitle: "Unlock the true potential of your machines with the Overclocker Upgrade a remarkable innovation that cuts waiting times by 25% per upgrade."
	quest.09399859E5722F15.title: "Samuel Aberg - 5"
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.quest_subtitle: "The simplest way to generate kinetic energy, by using yourself as the power source."
	quest.09611E6422C37869.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of wooden tools to complete this quest!"
	quest.09611E6422C37869.title: "Basic Tools"
	quest.09E861B40170663A.quest_subtitle: "By electrolyzing crushed flint you were able to extract the silicon from it, perhaps this could be used to enhance your power storage capabilities? \\n\\n To obtain silicon cells you electrolyze either 8 &dflint dust&r or 16 &dsand&r"
	quest.09FEB5C2CC65BB92.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 Nourishment Foods will give you a Nourishment Buff, which will make you immune to hunger (meaning you can't go hungry for 3 minutes!"
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.quest_subtitle: "A repeater that sends a pulse after a configurable amount of time."
	quest.0A6F439E158D1525.quest_subtitle: "A filter that can filter by attributes like \"can be smelted\" or \"from Create\"."
	quest.0AEB03456EB0F57B.quest_subtitle: "Sick and tired of that whining sound your machines make while working? I have just the thing for you, plop a muffler upgrade in your machine and i assure you... \\n\\n \"It's quieter than a mime trapped in a library during a power outage.\""
	quest.0B07F044C4AD8C6A.quest_subtitle: "Used in the creation of Engineering Processors in an Inscriber."
	quest.0B5FF13E714BF391.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network."
	quest.0B606A84A47E6984.quest_subtitle: "These are the basic building blocks of early-game Tech Reborn."
	quest.0B606A84A47E6984.title: "Basic Components"
	quest.0B64478B19862159.quest_subtitle: "Adds +4 Max Health and Slowness II effect on hit for 2 seconds"
	quest.0BB89DB5031ED247.title: "C418 - Mellohi"
	quest.0BF09160FB300459.quest_subtitle: "To help your crops grow faster, you can craft some Organic Compost, but there is more to do from here!"
	quest.0D9A4CB28AD2BC16.quest_subtitle: "Redstone block in the form of a backpack. Provides a strong redstone signal."
	quest.0DB617CD7576BF3C.quest_subtitle: "To be able to eat the Roast Chicken, it will need to be placed on a block and a bowl can be used to grab a portion."
	quest.0E491A562DF88795.quest_subtitle: "Weighted Ejectors can throw items accuratly long distances."
	quest.0E5EFCA75FF89DBD.quest_subtitle: "Holds mighty knowledge, place around an enchanting table just like a bookshelf to get higher-level enchantments."
	quest.0E82BECAC4A8AEAC.quest_subtitle: "A simple, elegant mix of gold and silver."
	quest.0EA4DBE7B695EF01.quest_subtitle: "Getting Deuterium is a three step process.\\n\\n1. Electrolyze 5 Water Cells \\n2. Centrifuge 5 Water Cells to get 4 Hydrogen Cells \\n3. Centrifuge 4 Hydrogen Cells to get 1 Deuterium Cell"
	quest.0EA4DBE7B695EF01.title: "Deuterium Cell"
	quest.0EDC1CB91ADAC3DB.quest_subtitle: "Used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Logic Plate to create a Printed Logic Circuit."
	quest.0F7A087CC11FB122.quest_subtitle: "Welcome brave traveller! Here you will start your journey on the main quest voyage! Are you up for it?"
	quest.0F7A087CC11FB122.title: "Welcome to Rizmotopia!"
	quest.0F7DD67C8DC41A18.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Porkchop to make Raw Bacon!"
	quest.0FAF8704191E5212.quest_subtitle: "Find or use a Netherite Upgrade Tier on a Diamond Traveler's Backpack in a smithing table to increase storage capacity! (Icon is only cosmetic)"
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.title: "Seats"
	quest.0FECC424EA9A9500.quest_subtitle: "Time to get tapping, here is a sapling to help you get started. \\n\\n By right-clicking the tree tap on the orange spots of a rubber tree you are able to extract sap that can be smelted into rubber. "
	quest.0FF69526C1DC1593.quest_subtitle: "Can be tamed with enchanted &cNetherite Chestplates&r. When tamed, they will occasionally drop enchanted books. "
	quest.0FF69526C1DC1593.title: "Find a &2Sculk Snapper"
	quest.10331210B10CF626.quest_subtitle: "Lets you use SU to break blocks, can also be attached to contraptions to make tunnel bores and the like."
	quest.10EA7C41CAA6CB69.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Iron tools to complete this quest!"
	quest.10EA7C41CAA6CB69.title: "Quite the upgrade!"
	quest.111C5864D82F7986.quest_subtitle: "By taking 9 of your newly found scraps you are able to create a scrap box that essentially is a loot box containing random goodies. Finally a good use for all that spare cobble you got laying around."
	quest.111C5864D82F7986.title: "Who said recycling couldn't be fun?"
	quest.119516C8AC04EF57.quest_subtitle: "If a player is going to die, creates explosion which damages every creature around, granting player absorption, regeneration and fire protection effects. (Ability is available every few minutes)"
	quest.119BED334E331C25.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.119BED334E331C25.title: "Enrich then Smelt"
	quest.12913E20A87ABA1F.quest_subtitle: "Allows for the creation of contraptions that move up and down."
	quest.1293EEC801BC50DB.quest_subtitle: "Congratulations, this is where the midgame of Tech reborn begins."
	quest.12C789BF2D021A55.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to smoke items."
	quest.12CAEA99C1F2148D.quest_subtitle: "Used in the creation of all Processors."
	quest.12D83CB0796A933C.quest_subtitle: "A rather useful alloy, mostly for creating mixed alloy ingots."
	quest.131306F185F2C173.quest_subtitle: "Cleanses all negative effects!"
	quest.133104619965D43A.title: "Aaron Cherof - Relic"
	quest.135C56073C33A3F2.quest_subtitle: "Lets start with some basic meals that will be better alternatives to the usual items like Bread or simple Cooked Meats!"
	quest.135C56073C33A3F2.title: "Basic Meals"
	quest.13CEADF2B3D86837.quest_subtitle: "To be able to eat the Honey Glazed Ham, it will need to be placed on a block and a bowl can be used to grab a portion."
	quest.13D4FF6929AE8D8F.quest_subtitle: "An item that allows for increased reach."
	quest.145B60BAC740910A.quest_subtitle: "Used in the creation of Logic Processors in an Inscriber."
	quest.1470FDEA91E38746.title: "C418 - Far"
	quest.1494D4D023A96CB4.quest_subtitle: "A machine that allows for more efficient use of raw resources, particularly useful for all that rubber you'll need."
	quest.14AAC7075B000B15.quest_subtitle: "A block designed to do one thing, store Storage Cells. This block holds 10 storage cells so you can tightly pack your storage into a very small space."
	quest.14BF4DDBBD36DC9E.quest_subtitle: "Your classic tunes that you can find."
	quest.152333F57A5C1913.quest_subtitle: "Crafts plates into rods and rods into wires."
	quest.155DDD4B9922FA5E.quest_subtitle: "Generates 20 E/t by consuming either diesel or nitro diesel."
	quest.155F388D56FB4A5F.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that can fell trees or allow contraptions to fell trees. As well as some crafting recipes like cutting blocks or stripping logs."
	quest.155FBDDA1C6194CA.quest_subtitle: "Lets you turn off parts of contraptions while they are formed."
	quest.165D860455970922.quest_subtitle: "A plate of silicon serves as a good base for a lot of electronics."
	quest.1693870F4F722022.quest_subtitle: "The simplest form of energy production, consumes any burnable item and turns it into energy."
	quest.16CD1CC9F70A91AF.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to halve or double the rotational speed of connected chaindrives when recieving a redstone signal."
	quest.1714FE36622421C5.quest_subtitle: "After breaking your machines with your fist for the 13th time, you realize there has to be a better way. \\n\\nThe wrench allows you to instantly break machines by shift+rightclicking and also allows for rotation by simply right-clicking"
	quest.171A4C89C39736B6.quest_subtitle: "A sizable upgrade to a battery box, allowing for 100x more power storage."
	quest.17541CB8E37D10F1.quest_subtitle: "Generates energy(E) from kinetic energy, the amount generated is dependent on the rpm and caps at 256E/t"
	quest.17B266199BEABA5C.title: "C418 - Blocks"
	quest.17CA52458876D1A2.quest_subtitle: "Electrolyzed from &dRuby dust&r or &dUvarovite dust&r"
	quest.17F560332DD3CF3D.quest_subtitle: "Holds significantly more power than your average battery."
	quest.1814D936233B07E4.quest_subtitle: "A Backpack Tank is an item used to craft a Traveler's Backpack. (You'll need a couple of these to get started)"
	quest.184C7C8DE8D3C466.quest_subtitle: "With its relentless force and precision, this mechanical masterpiece takes raw materials and subjects them to immense pressure. \\n\\nThis machine will be very handy on your journey through Tech Reborn."
	quest.18502D23303A1E69.quest_subtitle: "Made in the Industrial Blast Furnace."
	quest.18692829F29BE865.quest_subtitle: "If hostile mob is nearby, speed boost effect is granted."
	quest.19166D31F298D0D5.quest_subtitle: "Basically an advanced sign that updates faster if provided with higher RPM."
	quest.19183F380B49F31C.quest_subtitle: "A very versitile machine that can pull and push entities aswell as wash, haunt, blast and smoke items."
	quest.192EE909C57F390A.quest_subtitle: "Rare chance of spawning after breaking an &8Ancient Vase&r."
	quest.192EE909C57F390A.title: "Kill a &3Stalker"
	quest.1975556CF28F04D1.quest_subtitle: "A chip optimized for energy flow, allowing you to create machines with higher power consumption."
	quest.19E60D615F01DE4F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Iron Armor to complete this quest!"
	quest.19E60D615F01DE4F.title: "Ready for Battle!"
	quest.1A2F3CF0B221FD05.quest_subtitle: "An electric tool to replace your basic axes."
	quest.1A541F8D6FF3C21B.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to wash items.\\n\\nNotably soul sand into nether quartz."
	quest.1A87D47402DD7DEA.quest_subtitle: "Acquire a Netherite Ingot and Netherite Scrap to complete this quest!"
	quest.1ABC2ADBFEF3144D.quest_subtitle: "Connectors insert/extract energy from/into blocks and wires are used to connect between connectors."
	quest.1AF434AF64A9D1DD.quest_subtitle: "Extends range distance by 1 block."
	quest.1B0BC96171299950.quest_subtitle: "Adds Haste effect"
	quest.1B26C03FD0CDAAEA.quest_subtitle: "Now that you have some Certus Quartz Crystals it's time to charge them. Toss one into the Charger you made earlier and get to cranking!"
	quest.1C0835381B14085C.quest_subtitle: "By centrifuging lapis you are able to extract lazurite."
	quest.1C244E6307ABA4A4.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Stone tools to complete this quest!"
	quest.1C244E6307ABA4A4.title: "The next step up!"
	quest.1C6065E1743B9C52.quest_subtitle: "Absolutely necessary for making cupronickel rings and nichrome heating coils"
	quest.1C6CA3A75679DB99.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.1C8A1CCA830490CB.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in the overworld between y: -64 and y: 0"
	quest.1C8A1CCA830490CB.title: "Iridium Ore"
	quest.1CE4A4C7792FA259.quest_subtitle: "Mine your first Iron Ore"
	quest.1CE6DB5F873483AF.quest_subtitle: "Chutes are used to transfer between inventories vertically."
	quest.1D658C6375381BAA.quest_subtitle: "These meals are served in Bowls and will give you a Comfort Buff, which will make you immune to Cold and Sickness!"
	quest.1D658C6375381BAA.title: "Comfort Foods"
	quest.1DD5BD434117A8DE.quest_desc: ["Allows you to smelt 12.5 items per piece of coal"]
	quest.1DD5BD434117A8DE.quest_subtitle: "This offers a significant upgrade over the traditional furnace, providing the ability for easy automation and more fuel-efficient smelting capabilities."
	quest.1E8C6E6A6CDD5CDA.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 Nourishment Foods will give you a Nourishment Buff, which will make you immune to hunger (meaning you can't go hungry for 5 minutes!"
	quest.1F2AC22D367D6FFF.quest_subtitle: "A tool for harvesting ores and the like while keeping their shape intact."
	quest.1FFD224FD482EF52.quest_subtitle: "Provides energy from the sun, generates between 0 e/t and 12 e/t depending on the time of day."
	quest.2043E02E41A0B203.quest_subtitle: "Hello there, young music enthusiast! Considering that you're here, it means that you know that music is something we all need in our life! And these records are almost lost to time, but we can still salvage them! You must find them and listen to what they have to offer."
	quest.20EEBAECDE001362.quest_subtitle: "Made in the Industrial Blast Furnace."
	quest.21257050C6608D6E.quest_subtitle: "The Energy Acceptor converts energy from external systems into AE and stores it in the network.The following energy systems are supported: Forge Energy / Redstone Flux 2 FE = 1 AE."
	quest.21257050C6608D6E.title: "Powering Your Network 1"
	quest.2138553C5281A8D4.quest_subtitle: "An electric tool to replace your basic pickaxes."
	quest.2196F2FC33EE6E3E.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Chicken to make Raw Chicken Cuts!"
	quest.219E307B851DB05A.quest_subtitle: "Lets you reverse the direction of rotation by applying redstone."
	quest.21DD4EFBB31B669D.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Backtank."
	quest.227597F357AA480D.quest_subtitle: "Allows for the extraction of liquids from items."
	quest.2344262BE0555DED.quest_subtitle: "Adds +3 Armor to armor stats."
	quest.23A3426C70F9915B.quest_subtitle: "Kill 5 Wither Skeletons to receive a Wither Skeleton Skull!"
	quest.23E8B5EC08A0E818.quest_subtitle: "A slight upgrade over a Red Cell Battery"
	quest.2567CBAC31932921.quest_subtitle: "UNLIMITED POWER! Or well, at least close enough. \\n\\nUsing a fusion reactor you can create 16ke/t or maybe make some more of that, hard to get, iridium."
	quest.258F7C414BD13C89.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.26516BE37BFBC6CF.quest_subtitle: "Can drop up to 3 melon slices when harvested."
	quest.269B6488664B348B.quest_subtitle: "Well, it worked. But now it wont cool down. We're gonna need a machine for that."
	quest.2733B2543EF540E2.quest_subtitle: "Start by finding materials like Straw and various Wild Crops around the map!"
	quest.2795BF44F4E0D80D.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Cod to make Raw Cod Slices!"
	quest.27BAA1F4DE80AC55.quest_subtitle: "Stores up to 200,000 AE. They do not accept power directly, but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME Network."
	quest.27BAA1F4DE80AC55.title: "Storing Energy 1"
	quest.27BCA249C899D9D9.quest_subtitle: "Useful for canning all the things."
	quest.293196C72E44A5AC.quest_subtitle: "Lets you clear and pave whilst riding a train."
	quest.294215B4FB3EECE0.quest_subtitle: "By centrifuging 16 cells of helium you can get helium^3 which can be used in the fusion reactor for power generation."
	quest.295E413CB213B957.quest_subtitle: "Steel and Tungsten are usually not alloyable but perhaps an Industrial Blast Furnace can get hot enough?"
	quest.29649C654117D56A.quest_subtitle: "A lever that can be set to output any redstone level."
	quest.298D4BCDF00650A3.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Mutton to make Raw Mutton Chops!"
	quest.29BF285DA5DFCDD0.quest_subtitle: "Adds a Jump Boost and +10% Speed"
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.quest_subtitle: "Lets you instantly break most Create blocks by shift + right-clicking. And rotate them by right-clicking."
	quest.2A0E4313C171CC6C.quest_subtitle: "The recycler is the ultimate machine for getting rid of unwanted items, it accepts any item and simply turns it into scrap by using energy."
	quest.2A0F7A2AA1C0E9C1.quest_subtitle: "A basic filter."
	quest.2A78F8368B8F18B6.quest_subtitle: "Start by getting some basic ingredients for making meals!"
	quest.2AA2D0140E9B0F88.quest_subtitle: "Used to display inventories of ME Chests and to hold Storage Drives."
	quest.2AB0806AA6A7076C.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Helmet."
	quest.2BC564546A48616B.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that rotate around a point in space, particularly useful for farms."
	quest.2C0BD10615F7ECCA.quest_subtitle: "[\"\",\"Can be found in \",{\"text\":\"The End\",\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"45D9C9CD7B2568A0\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[]}},\".\"]"
	quest.2C0BD10615F7ECCA.title: "Tungsten Ore"
	quest.2C3CD6663D38750A.quest_subtitle: "Bonks ingots into plates."
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.quest_subtitle: "In order to get brass you're going to need to heat a mechanical mixer that's mixing copper and zinc.\\n\\n the Empty Blaze burner can be filled by right-clicking it on either a blaze spawner or a blaze."
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.title: "Blaze Burner"
	quest.2CB5CC1C5578F55C.quest_subtitle: "A battery that lets you change its energy output rate."
	quest.2CC43C68A8EECB8D.quest_subtitle: "The densest kinetic source. Although it also has the highest complexity, requiring a steady source of water and heat."
	quest.2D0B2D01669E88DD.quest_subtitle: "Simply a Potato Cannon."
	quest.2D3191960D3277B6.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create, a steampunk mod that lets you build contraptions to do most things you can think of.\\n\\nCreate offers great guides for most of its items by hovering over them in REI or in your inventory and holding down 'W' to \"ponder\" the item. This brings up a menu explaining to use said item.\\n\\nBecause of this the chapter is mostly focused on letting you know what exists and giving you a rough outline of the progression of the mod."
	quest.2D3191960D3277B6.title: "&6Welcome to Create!"
	quest.2DB4F8709A1E0F36.quest_subtitle: "Used to accelerate crystal growth, which allows you to create Certus Quartz Crystal andFluix Crystal from crystal dust. Must be powered by an ME Network via the top or bottom, and consumes a steady 8 ae/t while plugged in. Crystal Seeds must be in an adjacent water block to be effected, the seeds will shimmer more rapidly when in the presence of a powered Crystal Growth Accelerator. Can only connect to cables, or other networked machines on the top and bottom of the machine."
	quest.2E10D93D926631F6.quest_subtitle: "An item used to craft more advanced mechanical items."
	quest.2E3FBB60A25E5D78.quest_subtitle: "Made in the Industrial Blast Furnace."
	quest.2EBCE74AD6A417FD.quest_subtitle: "Find or craft a Traveler's Backpack to start your journey on upgrading  your backpack!"
	quest.2F3734B0518ED6E7.quest_subtitle: "Grants water breathing and night vision effects while being in water."
	quest.2F55B192381ACFEA.quest_subtitle: "Finally you have a reliable way of getting nickel. \\n\\nYou can get it by centrifuging raw gold ore, raw iron ore or raw copper ore."
	quest.30BD8CBF5829CCCC.quest_subtitle: "Blank upgrades are used to craft the smithing templates required for the next backpack tier upgrade."
	quest.312320F8FF1FDF24.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Copper Diving Boots."
	quest.3178264DBE8654D7.quest_subtitle: "Immunity to wither effect"
	quest.3205EC70BE4459B5.quest_subtitle: "Since the Iridium ore is so rare you might want to centrifuge some \\n&dPlatinum dust&r"
	quest.321F9684523A91C8.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of a furnace that allows it to run off of energy instead of coal."
	quest.337A1C160CA3B369.quest_subtitle: "Chop down your first Oak Tree"
	quest.337A1C160CA3B369.title: "Chop down a tree!"
	quest.3396F754ADE170A6.quest_subtitle: "Stumble upon a Nether Fortress!"
	quest.33A04B4FC89FBEC0.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.343E23C6DE215952.quest_subtitle: "Ghasts see you as an ally, unless you attack them."
	quest.34E1E575091AA498.quest_subtitle: "The ultimate cable"
	quest.35105F4914FBEC3B.quest_subtitle: "The Charger provides a way to charge supported tools through the ME Network or manually using a crank. It can also be used to create Charged Certus Quartz Crystal from Certus Quartz Crystal, and Meteorite Compass from Compass."
	quest.35105F4914FBEC3B.title: "Preparing to Find Meteorites 1"
	quest.35B27CC7FEF8F5A2.quest_subtitle: "As simple as compressing an ingot."
	quest.35C85EA3FCAA00F7.quest_subtitle: "A rather humble upgrade that increases the amount of energy your machines can store. Helpful for when having an external energy buffer isn't feasible."
	quest.35E8ACE804777937.quest_subtitle: "Craft an Iron Tier Upgrade for your Traveler's Backpack to upgrade storage capacity."
	quest.36F930BA493C2C11.quest_subtitle: "By canning helium cells we get helium coolant cells which can be useful for crafting superconductors and speed upgrades."
	quest.3736B545828490F1.quest_subtitle: "Some fluids can be infinity extracted from the world as long as the pool the hose pulley is extracting from contains 10000 or more source blocks.\\n\\nYou can search in REI for the fluids that apply using by typing \"$create:bottomless\""
	quest.37457328A40602CB.quest_subtitle: "Gives some cool particles, nothing special."
	quest.375D6E74A208E00D.title: "C418 - Cat"
	quest.37840D182E6A3A6D.quest_subtitle: "Adds +2 Armor to armor stats."
	quest.385C156051820A7B.quest_subtitle: "Stores pressurized air for usage with a diving helmet."
	quest.386BB0A6D8D16F8D.quest_subtitle: "Used in the creation of Calculation Processors in an Inscriber."
	quest.3887DB2CA518BC26.quest_subtitle: "A useful block for building contraptions."
	quest.39CF18F0C2B06818.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block structure that lets you store large amounts of energy."
	quest.3A48F4CC869FF2D2.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Basic Jackhammer.\\n\\nShift + Right-Click to swap modes."
	quest.3B10D31EFD80798C.quest_subtitle: "Lets you create your own custom functional clock."
	quest.3B37983AD8B3CF2E.quest_subtitle: "By integrating lapotron crystals with your MFE you can store 10x more power in the same space."
	quest.3B925864D243F779.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that allow contraptions to harvest crops."
	quest.3B94C5DE174F2129.quest_subtitle: "Ah, the chemical reactor. It facilitates the combining of a myriad of chemicals, allows for the conversion of rotten flesh into leather and importantly the crafting of &4Synthetic Redstone Crystal&r."
	quest.3C67BDE80F43FF9E.quest_subtitle: "Lets you charge certain items."
	quest.3C7470C5AD12685B.quest_subtitle: "Obtained from either electrolyzing &4Bauxite dust&r or industrially grinding &dHearts of the Sea&r."
	quest.3CBDB45D65737212.quest_subtitle: "Found by stepping on Infested Sculk"
	quest.3CBDB45D65737212.title: "Kill a &7Shriek Worm"
	quest.3D11842DDDE1D396.quest_subtitle: "Terminoloy:\\n\\nStress Units(SU) a number that describes how much stress something generates or requires to run.\\n\\n"
	quest.3D1AAE6D95AE2CD1.quest_subtitle: "Provides energy from the sun, generates between 32 e/t and 512 e/t depending on the time of day."
	quest.3D550CD9EEE29E6F.quest_subtitle: "Medium tier processor."
	quest.3D5BF7E05FE7FF71.quest_subtitle: "Redstone is a component when creating Processors."
	quest.3D83ACA3A3735FA2.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Beef to make Minced Beef!"
	quest.3E67DAE79B01978E.quest_subtitle: "Farmer's Delight adds much more food, farming and cooking options!"
	quest.3EADB5F22FAD4A56.quest_subtitle: "An upgrade to the andesite tunnel allowing more configurability in how to deal with items."
	quest.3F52CA864550295E.quest_subtitle: "Works like a sponge block and stores water in backpack tanks. (It is required to not have empty or not fully water filled tanks for ability to work)"
	quest.3F78E4BE4349CD6F.quest_subtitle: "To make the best meals Farmers Delight has to offer, you will need a Cutting Board and a Knife to cut up your meats!"
	quest.3F8B59B04E26C1C2.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that only allows energy(E) to flow when it's receiving a redstone signal."
	quest.3FECABA69B0DCC9F.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Diamond Tools to complete this quest!"
	quest.4007D36163F8555E.quest_subtitle: "Grinding it all down to dust."
	quest.408D9361AF8AA499.quest_subtitle: "A simple machine with massive potential. Can place blocks but also use items on blocks/entities."
	quest.40A44D18576BC155.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1 Nourishment Foods will give you a Nourishment Buff, which will make you immune to hunger (meaning you can't go hungry for 1 minute!"
	quest.40A44D18576BC155.title: "Tier 1 Nourishment Foods"
	quest.40E8EBF7F584D035.quest_subtitle: "For all your sawing needs."
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.title: "Cogwheels"
	quest.413301782F770B3C.quest_subtitle: "The highest tier of circuit, a lot of these are needed for lapotron crystals. They're also useful for making the chips cheaper in the assembling machine."
	quest.413B1C5E81B5D155.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.4206216A5F414642.title: "Item Manipulation"
	quest.4267B97B18413E1D.quest_subtitle: "Since most blocks in Create don't allow for manual extraction and insertion of liquids these pipes are rather useful.\\n\\nCan also be used to create infinite water by extracting from a source-block that has 2 source-blocks adjacent to it."
	quest.42A4FAD05869BF4A.quest_subtitle: "Silicon can be crafted by smelting Certus Quartz Dust. It's used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Silicon Press to create Printed Silicon."
	quest.42ABEAAF59DE2B3F.quest_subtitle: "This is the start of the Main Questline, Gather the basic materials in Minecraft to complete this section. (more to be added in future updates)"
	quest.42FB5B16A87CECF1.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.431ED7C239E9EAAD.quest_subtitle: "Provides energy from the sun, generates between 4 e/t and 24 e/t depending on the time of day."
	quest.4329D355F5B2E80D.quest_subtitle: "Used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Engineering Plate to create a Printed Engineering Circuit."
	quest.4377B43142216C8D.quest_subtitle: "A helmet that lets you use air from an equipped tank to breathe underwater."
	quest.445CC9AAA6F8AAB6.title: "Making Oxygen for Purifier"
	quest.44937B2D2EB38094.quest_subtitle: "Used to negate the darkness in &8&lThe Otherside."
	quest.44937B2D2EB38094.title: "Craft a &9Warden Helmet"
	quest.44AE17D3427B487C.quest_subtitle: "\"A fancier rope pulley\"\\n\\nAllows for the creation of elevators."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.quest_subtitle: "Allows for movement of structures linearly using rotational force."
	quest.44C3B2628015505C.title: "Mechanical Pistons"
	quest.44E0DDEE0578557F.quest_subtitle: "A multi-block item storage that can't be accessed manually."
	quest.450844598EA2B15C.quest_subtitle: "Allows for the creation of fluids using uu-matter and energy."
	quest.452FE521007EE0D9.quest_subtitle: "To craft a meteorite compass, charge a normal compass in a Charger. This can be done very early by using a Wooden Crank.The Meteorite Compass points in the direction of the nearest Meteorite within a range of 2,700 blocks. If the compass is spinning rapidly there is Sky Stone in your chunk! If the compass is spinning slowly, then you need to explore more because you're out of range of the nearest Meteorite."
	quest.452FE521007EE0D9.title: "Preparing to Find Meteorites 2"
	quest.45300F814DAE65A3.quest_subtitle: "Using a Cutting Board, Cut Raw Salmon to make Raw Salmon Slices!"
	quest.458F77D5647A05A9.quest_subtitle: "[\"\",\"Can be found in \",{\"text\":\"The End\",\"color\":\"dark_purple\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"45D9C9CD7B2568A0\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[]}},\".\"]"
	quest.459C7FC80344C565.quest_subtitle: "40% chance to multiply crop drops and a 15% chance to obtain an edible crop from grass"
	quest.45A0A55BF2CA1F2B.quest_subtitle: "Generates 0.1 E/t per side touching water."
	quest.46D0AAEEB69E28B3.title: "Enter &cThe Nether"
	quest.4795979571F1FAEA.quest_subtitle: "A modified furnace capable of generating AE Power instead of smelting ores. When placed on an ME Network it will charge Energy Cell or power other Network Devices.The Vibration Chamber will burn almost any solid burnable fuel for power. It will slow, or accelerate the burn depending on how much power it is able to store vs what is wasted. Generates between 1 and 10 AE/t depending on its burn speed."
	quest.4795979571F1FAEA.title: "Powering your Network 2"
	quest.47AB06080C9AB19A.title: "C418 - Chirp"
	quest.47F58263B3BC7423.quest_subtitle: "Obtained through Electrolyzing emerald dust or Ender Peal dust"
	quest.482FB4D238CC8BF7.quest_subtitle: "Advanced Meals consist of multiple combined ingredients to make a full meal that also include buffs!"
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.quest_subtitle: "The thing your train goes on."
	quest.48E5D56C47DF6642.title: "Train Tracks"
	quest.49EE6F88CD93352E.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to blast items."
	quest.4A041E600B41F4C3.quest_subtitle: "Used alongside an Inscriber and Inscriber Calculation Plate to create a Printed Calculation Circuit."
	quest.4AABEFF8E855D8D8.quest_subtitle: "Fluix ME Glass Cable is the simplest cable to make, transfers power and up to 8 Channels. It comes in 17 different colors, the default being Fluix, and can be dyed any color using any of the 16 dyes."
	quest.4AE8F4A153B06D00.quest_subtitle: "After gong through one too many treetaps it might be time to make an electric tool to replace them."
	quest.4B1A6E2F469AAE0B.quest_subtitle: "Seems like vacuum freezing it works, now to turn it into something more usable."
	quest.4B2D031595A25305.quest_subtitle: "A component used in the creation of an ME Terminal."
	quest.4B40C13EA305BB76.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Netherite Armor to complete this quest!"
	quest.4B8D34860B127B5C.quest_subtitle: "With its enhanced properties, refined iron serves as the foundation for constructing advanced devices and intricate circuits."
	quest.4C244A59E076A502.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Tech Reborn! A tech mod that provides options for power power generation, power storage, bulk item storage, tools and the creation of materials from energy and scrap."
	quest.4D4E1A1CF18B9E25.quest_subtitle: "Find or use an Iron Upgrade Tier on a Traveler's Backpack in a smithing table to increase storage capacity! (Icon is only cosmetic)"
	quest.4D7C156BFE9CD2C0.title: "Lena Raine - Otherside"
	quest.4D85BA63BD54984A.quest_subtitle: "Tritium is obtained by simply centrifuging 4 Deuterium Cells"
	quest.4D9E2C79AE415CA5.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Gold Tier Upgrade for your Traveler's Backpack to upgrade storage capacity."
	quest.4DE4854B1262E735.quest_subtitle: "To start, you'll want to get a little kitchen setup going by making a Stove, Cooking Pot and a Skillet"
	quest.4DE4854B1262E735.title: "Cooking"
	quest.4DE6A29C5AD208B8.quest_subtitle: "Backpack obtainable in Armorer villager's chests"
	quest.4E0503134BFF19F0.quest_subtitle: "A block that can monitor the fill levels of inventories and tanks."
	quest.4E834477717F726A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to control the train."
	quest.4F4BD62088952B4A.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.4F602E2F6FAB89A4.quest_subtitle: "These crystals very suitable for energy storage, but not by themselves, perhaps with some silicon?"
	quest.4F61B1F3D1E2C6E2.quest_subtitle: "The main block used for bulk fluid storage."
	quest.4F9E70C8F6B4F8C3.quest_desc: [
		"Place Organic Compost in direct sunlight with a water source in the vacinity!"
		""
		"Over time this will turn the Organic Compost into Rich Soil!"
		""
		"You can speed this up by placing Mushrooms or other various supported blocks on or near the Organic Compost! (Check recipe Description for more info)"
		""
		"Now your crops will grow even faster!"
	]
	quest.4F9E70C8F6B4F8C3.quest_subtitle: "Making Rich Soil from Organic Compost"
	quest.50C0D23949DD8BE6.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to stop rotational force coming through when powered by a redstone signal."
	quest.5117C21E8354B7B0.quest_subtitle: "Backpack for real warriors, combines Magma's Cube and Squid's backpack abilities, plus gives you strength and regeneration! You'll be invincible!.... but... what did it cost?"
	quest.511F3C68A35B3376.quest_subtitle: "An upgrade to the Advanced Drill, allowing it to mine in a 3x3 area when activated."
	quest.5158324CF1B1D4B6.quest_subtitle: "Requiring 30ke and 30 scrap per uu-matter"
	quest.51A9F4178437FD07.quest_subtitle: "Generates 16 E/t by consuming lava."
	quest.51C20BC96894193F.quest_subtitle: "Obtained by centrifuging &dClay dust&r."
	quest.52C1D5727A82A72F.quest_subtitle: "Tunnels are used to manage the flow of items on belts."
	quest.5332DD7FCF03598D.quest_subtitle: "Adds +2 Armor to armor stats."
	quest.536544634014189A.quest_subtitle: "To be able to eat the Shepherd's Pie, it will need to be placed on a block and a bowl can be used to grab a portion."
	quest.5377541DA4BDA88B.quest_subtitle: "A tool made specifically to mine through stone-like blocks. \\n\\nMeaning it doesn't mine ores. Good for making tunnels or clearing spaces."
	quest.541988089F760BD6.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that toggles its state with every redstone pulse."
	quest.54636677E54B866A.quest_subtitle: "By harnessing the power of centrifugal forces the Industrial Centrifuge allows for the extraction of several new resources."
	quest.54C354CE29DB58D1.title: "C418 - Wait"
	quest.550922A9A8A74FE9.quest_subtitle: "An upgrade to the Advanced Chainsaw, allowing it to fell entire trees in one swing."
	quest.552355955AC25D94.quest_subtitle: "Kill 5 Blaze to complete this quest!"
	quest.5531416A72A727DD.quest_subtitle: "Generates 16 E/t using Methane or Hydrogen."
	quest.5576B14826CD00EC.quest_subtitle: "Adds +4 Armor to your Armor stats."
	quest.5611FCC58301372A.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to setup a sequence of rotations that are executed upon the block receiving a redstone signal."
	quest.572DF2570C4C66DB.quest_subtitle: "Generates 256 kE/bolt of lightning. Place iron fences on top of it, attaching more than one will increase the chance that lightning hits the rod."
	quest.57706419A89EA464.quest_subtitle: "As simple as compressing an ingot."
	quest.580F229A31EACBEB.quest_subtitle: "A basic machine that converts ingots into wire, making for more efficient use of the material."
	quest.58CE8D332141224C.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.58FAEDF045C230B7.quest_subtitle: "Immunity to fire damage."
	quest.5962DB7143D9AD5F.quest_subtitle: "Inscriber Presses are found in the Sky Chest at the center of a Meteorite. They can be used to create circuits in an Inscriber."
	quest.5962DB7143D9AD5F.title: "Inscriber Presses"
	quest.5A13FA3A0CA0D42E.quest_subtitle: "In older versions of the mod (minecraft v1.12) machines used to blow up and cables would break if you used a power tier too high for them. This is no longer the case although you will still see the transformers in rei, they are not needed.\\n\\n TLDR Transformers are only useful for restricting energy flow."
	quest.5A13FA3A0CA0D42E.title: "Energy tiers"
	quest.5A87DA6254DBC186.title: "C418 - Stal"
	quest.5C06543962E420C4.quest_subtitle: "A motor that converts energy(E) into kinetic energy(SU) at any rpm."
	quest.5C1C97B733DF4574.title: "C418 - 13"
	quest.5C320307CEC5B785.quest_subtitle: "We're in the endgame now!"
	quest.5CDDAD4D40B67D7B.quest_subtitle: "A redstone component that extends a pulse to a configurable amount."
	quest.5CFE6E363FC52BDD.quest_subtitle: "Most Advanced Processor."
	quest.5D007FE75F9D49CD.quest_subtitle: "Provides energy from the sun, generates between 8 e/t and 48 e/t depending on the time of day."
	quest.5D0986618729A519.quest_subtitle: "A block that can look for specific items in the world or in inventories."
	quest.5D18BF9A5C0EAE34.quest_subtitle: "Have you ever wanted to be a chicken? No? Well, now you are! You'll lay eggs!"
	quest.5D3A89762F7D75E1.quest_subtitle: "Welcome, young collector, for here you see before you is a place where trinkets and accessories are gathered and admired by those around you. Are you up for the challenge?"
	quest.5D3A89762F7D75E1.title: "A Collector's Journey"
	quest.5E04B024C8E9B865.quest_subtitle: "Used for filling items with fluids and crafting certain items using fluids."
	quest.5EFC618DEDFC9104.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.5FF617620A38A716.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies this item allows you to glue blocks together. Perticularly useful when making contraptions."
	quest.60D073A200595414.quest_subtitle: "Lets you see the current stress and stress capacity of a kinetic network."
	quest.617D59D4F14FA3AE.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that traverse rails in the same way minecarts do."
	quest.618FF4D4A0FCC14C.quest_subtitle: "Lets you place down a mirror that assists you in building symmetrical things."
	quest.6270F1A6D37F24CD.quest_subtitle: "This malleable substance allows you to craft a multitude of materials, to think it was only created using scrap and energy."
	quest.629259C39B042BA4.quest_subtitle: "Find or upgrade your current Backpack to one with special abilities, or to one for purely cosmetics only!"
	quest.629259C39B042BA4.title: "Special Ability Traveler's Backpacks"
	quest.62C3A712591A293B.quest_subtitle: "\"Jack of all trades, master of none.\" \\n\\nThis tool functions as a pickaxe, axe, shovel and sword."
	quest.62CF041CC3936840.quest_subtitle: "Your most basic form of power storage.\\n\\nKeep in mind that the dot is the output and everything else is input for all power storage blocks in this Tech Reborn."
	quest.642172D58E8B11E1.quest_subtitle: "A kinetic source that uses the flow of water as its source of energy. Will generate the same amount of SU at the same RPM as long as one block of flowing water is adjacent.\\n\\nYou can also swich the look of your water wheel by right-clicking it with pretty much any wood plank (including ones from other mods)."
	quest.6475E37D4C042017.quest_subtitle: "Traveler's Backpacks are items you can wear as a seperate slot on your back. You'll also be able to upgrade your backpack to a higher tier allowing for more storage capacity!"
	quest.649045BE6DED01C9.quest_subtitle: "This crystal possesses the unique ability to absorb and convert energy from one form to another, and is the foundation of all ME technology. Fluix Crystal is crafted by placing Charged Certus Quartz Crystal , Nether Quartz and Redstone Dust in water. It will quickly start to react, and result in a Fluix Crystal."
	quest.65503022D5B1F4E8.quest_subtitle: "Remnants of a bygone era, transformers are a thing of the past."
	quest.65A2AC554D856D93.quest_subtitle: "Allows for contraptions that move across gantries."
	quest.65E79EAA20C0778C.quest_subtitle: "\"This machine does it for you!\", got too many Scrapboxes for two hands? Well you're in luck, craft it now! The Scrapbox-inator opens any Scrapbox at the low-low cost of 32 E/t."
	quest.666E9828756ADB0C.quest_subtitle: "The basis of most things fluid related in Create.\\n\\nCan also be used to encase fluid pipes."
	quest.669CF3656A35FE34.quest_subtitle: "Feeds you slowly with delicious pieces of cake."
	quest.672C61B048CB3B85.quest_subtitle: "In order to make a train you're going to need at least:\\n- 1 Train Casing\\n- 1 Train Station\\n- Enough train tracks to make your railroad.\\n\\nIn order to see how you assemble a train \"ponder\" the train station."
	quest.6788899CEE17F629.quest_subtitle: "Find Wild Crops apart of the Farmer's Delight mod around the world!"
	quest.67B3D0A82F1BB3EA.quest_subtitle: "The basis for more advanced blocks."
	quest.67CE399D0A9C0F57.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that both allow for automatic crafting of normal recipes and the crafting of recipes that are bigger than a normal crafting table would allow for."
	quest.67E7A9A65B14C933.title: "Crush and Enrich Clumps"
	quest.67FA1292129370E6.quest_subtitle: "Sky Stone Blocks are crafted by melting Sky Stone in a furnace."
	quest.68487E90AA4A1FC5.quest_subtitle: "The ME Chest is the simplest way to use a Storage cell, it will give you direct access to the contents of the cell placed inside. It can be powered stand alone with external power, or as part of a ME Network. When on a network, the storage of the chest will be available to any other devices in the same network using an assigned Channel. When used without a network, the chest will not transfer full stacks at once, capping transfers at 38 items instead."
	quest.6864CCEF75E30163.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.687110654C670C56.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Crafting Upgrade for your Traveler's Backpack to be able to have a crafting menu within your backpack!"
	quest.68CC0DF64AD608C1.quest_subtitle: "Generates twice as much SU as the regular water wheel but at a slower RPM."
	quest.6AD5669684405040.title: "C418 - Mall"
	quest.6AFD022E4050ECB5.quest_subtitle: "Lets you display real-time information to a connected display board or nixie tube."
	quest.6B52D321A0EF5F16.quest_subtitle: "If you're tired of charging your items one-by-one I have just the thing for you, the chare-o-mat allows for the charging of 6 items at once."
	quest.6BA447460C86D318.title: "C418 - Strad"
	quest.6C26214738805896.quest_subtitle: "Essential for any person working with Create. Allows you to see more information about blocks like stress impact."
	quest.6C887F8DFF634198.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Diamond Tier Upgrade for your Traveler's Backpack to upgrade storage capacity."
	quest.6C9B0FDA7EE4B25D.quest_subtitle: "Made in the Industrial Blast Furnace."
	quest.6CE47960B6FEF89D.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to place or extract large bodies of liquid."
	quest.6CF436D4831F590C.quest_subtitle: "A wrench made of Certus Quartz Crystal or Nether Quartz. Useful for rotating blocks, and removing individual parts from cables."
	quest.6CF436D4831F590C.title: "Rotating Your Machines"
	quest.6D17293BBEDF3958.quest_subtitle: "A component used to create an ME Terminal."
	quest.6E7D3242496F4501.title: "Kill a &3Shattered"
	quest.6F294BDDCBE56ADC.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the Basic Chainsaw."
	quest.6F3656370E280D7E.quest_subtitle: "&4[CAUTION]&r At the Highest setting this WILL launch you about 250 blocks into the air"
	quest.6F39437263FE73EE.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Artifacts! These are wearable trinkets to give certain buffs! You can find these in Lootr Chests (Rare), or at campsites inside of caves, but be careful... the chests found in caves may fight back!"
	quest.6F4B091DDC613408.quest_subtitle: "Blocks that allow contraptions to create farmland or launch entities."
	quest.6F8C6808A1DFFAF6.quest_subtitle: "You can obtain platinum dust by using the Industrial grinder to either grind &dIridium ore&r, &dSheldonite ore&r or \\n&dHearts of the Sea&r"
	quest.6FB5FA2FACF2C776.quest_subtitle: "An improved energy crystal, allowing for even higher levels of energy storage."
	quest.6FDBDD89518BE8CC.quest_subtitle: "With a drain you can pull any liquid above it into it, a simple use case for this could be creating infinite water."
	quest.6FE1CBDF3A7515EC.quest_subtitle: "A component used to create an ME Terminal."
	quest.70132A3A1D58A70B.quest_subtitle: "For the late-game you are going to need a lot of tungsten. One way of obtaining it is by centrifuging lava or endstone dust."
	quest.704397EA5FB54FB4.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Diamond Armor to complete this quest!"
	quest.704CCA2CEAB23B4D.quest_subtitle: "Before lighting the portal, you must first remove all &3Sculk Veins &rfrom the inner frame. After the frame is cleared, you can right click it with the &bHeart of The Deep &rthat you got earlier from killing The Warden."
	quest.704CCA2CEAB23B4D.title: "&lEntering:&r &8&lThe Otherside"
	quest.7088750D467E771E.quest_subtitle: "Allows for fine tuning of rpm."
	quest.70CAFBB921F1723A.quest_subtitle: "Find or use a Diamond Upgrade Tier on a Gold Traveler's Backpack in a smithing table to increase storage capacity! (Icon is only cosmetic)"
	quest.72A81CC09FB3CACD.quest_subtitle: "Similar to a Hand Crank but only turns a certain amount of degrees with each interaction."
	quest.72A81CC09FB3CACD.title: "Valve Handles"
	quest.72B121F49AA7BD7B.quest_subtitle: "Chance to multiply amount of experience which is received by player."
	quest.72F3965D09F3B6F0.quest_subtitle: "Ever wanted to pipe liquids into your blaze burners? Just hand them a straw and they'll slurp it straight from the pipe.\\n\\nYou can press 'U' on the straw to see what liquids it accepts as well as burn times."
	quest.7312551AD8A0A859.quest_subtitle: "Generates 500 E/t by consuming heliumplasma."
	quest.731C3214BB61FDAE.quest_subtitle: "Found underground in the &aOverworld&r."
	quest.731C3214BB61FDAE.title: "&lDefeat&r &3The Warden"
	quest.736D489426858C6C.quest_subtitle: "Most basic processor."
	quest.73A2838E56534342.quest_subtitle: "Allows contraptions to transfer fluids to blocks."
	quest.743284A1B75A8DF4.quest_subtitle: "Generates 4 E/t as long as it has a dragon egg on top of it."
	quest.7452A3A5599B09AB.quest_subtitle: "A block that allows input and output of inventories 1 item at a time.\\n\\nOne thing not mentioned by the ponder is that the funnel can drop items on the ground when placed on an inventory and will only keep 1 item on the ground if it's close enough to the block the item lands on."
	quest.74ADDF7066B30B3F.quest_subtitle: "Allows for multiple paralell rotational outputs."
	quest.754DEFB6247B4FB5.quest_subtitle: "The ME Controller is the routing hub of a ME Network. Without it, only up to 8 devices can interact, any more and everything stops working.It is not possible to have 2 ME Controller in one ME Network.Unlike most ME Network devices, the ME Controller does not require channels, rather it emits them 8 or 32 per side, depending how many channels the device supports."
	quest.757B12A4C7F7D355.quest_subtitle: "A more advanced funnel that allows for filtering and higher stack sizes."
	quest.75A4BA8547564888.quest_subtitle: "Stores AE energy up to 1.6 million units. They do not accept power directly but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing ME Network."
	quest.75A4BA8547564888.title: "Storing Energy 2"
	quest.75B2CB75748D5D15.quest_subtitle: "To be able to eat the Stuffed Pumpkin, it will need to be placed on a block and a bowl can be used to grab a portion."
	quest.75E4751F7A802A44.title: "Creating Sulfuric Acid"
	quest.75F9505657FC73C7.quest_subtitle: "[\"\",\"The configuration system for machines can feel daunting for some. But here's a brief primer on it for anyone that needs it.\",\"\\n\",\"\\n\",\"To open the configuration system you click the wrench on the lefts side of the UI in any Tech Reborn machine that supports it. Then you press the slot you want to configure, this opens up a pop-up that shows how it's currently configured for that side, and then you press the side you want to configure to cycle through input, output and disabled. You can also check the box for the auto-input or auto-output to make the machine push/pull from the inventory adjacent to the configured sides.\",\"\\n\",\"\\n\",\"If you need something in video format \",{\"text\":\"Click Here \",\"color\":\"light_purple\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZPFeYfYnbZ8\"}},\"to see a short video from the mod-creator on the system.\"]"
	quest.75F9505657FC73C7.title: "Machine configuration"
	quest.7649744CC59CA17A.quest_subtitle: "A component used in the creation of an illuminated panel."
	quest.7667BBB2FDBEE6FD.quest_subtitle: "An incredibly powerful alloy, only used for the most powerful items."
	quest.768D5C3D77FF6E73.quest_subtitle: "Made in the Industrial Blast Furnace."
	quest.76DD55E24F62275B.quest_subtitle: "Gather Cobblestone"
	quest.76DD55E24F62275B.title: "Mine Cobblestone"
	quest.776F0CA023690BC6.quest_subtitle: "Can display text or numbers."
	quest.77A03E3352B23809.quest_subtitle: "No extra effects (Only cosmetic)"
	quest.784FB68F70299F18.quest_subtitle: "When placed on the Encased Fan the Nozzle changes the area of effect of the pushing/pulling into a sphere instead of a line."
	quest.7852E93432E03A2F.quest_subtitle: "Have you ever tried climbing walls?"
	quest.798A2936F8F101CE.quest_subtitle: "Aluminum is a component in a lot of things around you. However the most readily available should be clay and bauxite.\\n\\n To get aluminum it's recommended to electrolyze &dClay dust&r / &dBauxite dust&r or industrially grind &dBauxite ore&r"
	quest.798CADF6B8930572.quest_subtitle: "A machine that can autocraft shapeless recepies aswell as mix things like potions.\\n\\nNeeds to rotate at at least 30 rpm to function"
	quest.7991B5D4970CDCFE.quest_subtitle: "A component required for making item and fluid storage cells. Storage Cells, are one of the core mechanics of storage in Applied Energistics 2, there are three kinds: one for items, one for fluids, and one for regions of space."
	quest.7A66434DF1E38F35.quest_subtitle: "Find or use a Gold Upgrade Tier on an Iron Traveler's Backpack in a smithing table to increase storage capacity! (Icon is only cosmetic)"
	quest.7A9BF614BFF17898.quest_subtitle: "Can ONLY be acquired by buying it from a Librarian villager"
	quest.7ADC3916197FD452.quest_subtitle: "By centrifuging 8 marble dust you can get yourself a small amount of magnesium dust."
	quest.7B3913CCEBC7717D.quest_subtitle: "Gives off a redstone signal when detecting a train."
	quest.7B86674432D514BF.quest_subtitle: "If you're running low on resources, now might be the time to get an assembling machine as it allows for some alternate crafts for circuits that cut down on costs. \\n\\nOne specific recipe that might of interest is the &dElytra&r but how are you going to get those End Rods?"
	quest.7B9D2F7F33818837.quest_subtitle: "Essentially the an upgrade to the millstone, provides some different recipes so it might be worth keeping both around."
	quest.7BC9CFF0EA46A28F.title: "Lena Raine - Pigstep"
	quest.7BCA3069494D846D.quest_subtitle: "By using Mercury instead of water in your industrial grinder you can significantly increase its yield. \\n\\nObtained by centrifuging either redstone dust or cinnabar dust"
	quest.7C20055475FCD3E8.quest_subtitle: "Using two iron furnaces and some refined iron you are able to fashion a primitive alloy smelter allowing for some new materials to be created."
	quest.7C4A651642FB10AE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Netherite Tier Upgrade for your Traveler's Backpack to upgrade storage capacity."
	quest.7C5CDB413D2EBD0C.quest_subtitle: "Copycat blocks allow you to make steps and panels out of things that typically cannot take those shapes."
	quest.7DCD72A866305342.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Netherite Tools to complete this quest!"
	quest.7E8E6019017D76EC.quest_subtitle: "Sticks to blocks when powered by redstone."
	quest.7EA4E2D90A0FBC21.quest_subtitle: "Allows you to walk underwater like you do on land as well as walk on belts without them moving you."
	quest.7F098E39492F5712.quest_subtitle: "To craft the processors required for more advanced machines, you'll need the Inscriber. Each type of processor has an associated press, which you will find in meteorites. Each operation requires 1k AE charged up."
	quest.7F112237ADC4BA6B.quest_subtitle: "Acts like a real-life cacti, if it's raining and above backpack is clear sky, the backpack will fill empty tanks with water over time. (If you want some more water, dip yourself! The backpack can fill with water while being a block too)"
	quest.7F4D5B0A7A3CA576.quest_subtitle: "Used to controll the flow of trains across tracks and intersections of tracks."
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.quest_subtitle: "Lets you transfer a redstone signal wirelessly within a range."
